    {
      "id": "08-pros",
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "pros",
      "text": "Positives first: anthocyanin-rich berry pigments. The red-purple pigment story adds a food-specific antioxidant angle. Exceptional fibre for a fruit. Raspberries are one of the clearest fruit examples where fibre changes the sugar story. Sweet-tart flavour without a huge sugar load. They taste sweet, but the sugar number stays restrained for fruit.",
