        "historyItemId": "sOGce31vAjkmmqVo1GQ3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "09-cons",
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "cons",
      "text": "Downsides next: very short shelf life. They spoil quickly, so waste and timing matter. Tiny seeds can bother some people. The seed texture is part of the fruit, but not everyone likes it. Price swings hard out of season. Fresh raspberries can become expensive compared with sturdier fruit.",
      "textSha256": "338e03d87e5ed5f9632585faebdd84319315810daae25a9de29254519a65d941",
      "characterCount": 289,
      "byteLength": 274643,
      "audioFile": "production/episodes/raspberries/voice/voice-v3-blocks/09-cons.mp3",
      "elevenLabs": {
